      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(ae) a summary of the information:\n\nAmendment of the Telecommunications (Interception) Act 1979  Schedule 2\nCivil forfeiture proceedings and named person warrants  Part 4\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Telecommunications Interception and Other Measures) Act 2005\nNo. 95, 2005            11\n\n(i) that is required under subsection 84(1A) to be included\nby the Ombudsman in the report made under subsection\n84(1); and\n\n(ii) that relates to the year to which the Minister’s report\nrelates; and\n\nSchedule 2  Amendment of the Telecommunications (Interception) Act 1979",
